# ── src-tauri/icons/icon.png ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The host's copy (this repo's own src-tauri/icons/icon.png, generated by
# #3287) is the real 1024x1024 AutoLogo brand icon rasterized for this
# project. The template must ship a neutral placeholder instead — every
# downstream `create-zudo-doc` scaffold would otherwise carry zudo-doc's own
# brand mark rather than a blank slate for the new project to replace. The
# placeholder's only contract is "valid 8-bit RGBA PNG" so
# `tauri::generate_context!()` does not panic on a non-RGBA color type
# (src-tauri/README.md records that requirement; see #3264/#3287/#3309). It
# is therefore the same 32x32 stub already used by the tauriDev feature's
# host counterpart (src-tauri-dev/icons/icon.png, which needs no allowlist
# entry because it IS the placeholder there too) — reused verbatim rather
# than generated fresh, so its PNG-shape correctness is already proven.
# Byte parity with the host's real brand icon is therefore neither expected
# nor desired.
src-tauri/icons/icon.png
